INFO 2026-04-15 16:36:11,197 accounts.api_io [request_id=DD222C16-05D7-4EB4-A5DF-5676EA6E55AE] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "localhost:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.300.31 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2MjcxMDM4LCJpYXQiOjE3NzYyNjkyMzgsImp0aSI6IjUyNTBkN2JjMjAzMTQwMDBhMzVlNDczNTIwODJkY2FkIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjMifQ.16tN1W4kBsr2-RGj5PMRyu4WAtA07BdjcWhG8wnyT5o", "X-Request-Id": "DD222C16-05D7-4EB4-A5DF-5676EA6E55AE", "Content-Length": "6334"} body={"messages": [{"reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-04-15T16:35:55.897Z", "content": "我三年高血压，帮我创建测量任务", "client_message_id": "EEE21A59-AA5D-40B1-9850-905A52D81108", "role": "user", "thread_id": "922B245B-D1A6-4F52-8147-058F77FD5DB2", "delivery_state": "pending", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_expanded": false}, {"reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-04-15T16:36:11.183Z", "content": "根据您三年高血压的病史，我为您规划以下血压测量任务：\n\n## 🩺 血压测量任务建议\n\n### 日常监测任务\n| 项目 | 建议 |\n|------|------|\n| **测量频率** | 每天早晚各1次 |\n| **测量时间** | 晨起后、睡前（固定时间） |\n| **每次测量** | 连续测2-3次，取平均值 |\n| **记录内容** | 收缩压/舒张压、心率、测量时间 |\n\n### 任务提醒设置\n- **早测提醒**：每天 7:00\n- **晚测提醒**：每天 21:00\n- **复诊提醒**：每3个月一次\n\n### 血压控制目标\n| 指标 | 目标值 |\n|------|--------|\n| 收缩压 | < 140 mmHg（理想<130）|\n| 舒张压 | < 90 mmHg（理想<80）|\n| 心率 | 60-100 次/分 |\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 重要提示**：\n- 测量前静坐5分钟，避免运动、吸烟、饮咖啡后立即测量\n- 如血压持续≥140/90 mmHg 或 <90/60 mmHg，请及时就医\n- 按时服药，不要自行调整降压药剂量\n\n需要我帮您将这些任务添加到系统提醒中吗？", "client_message_id": "B0B62488-C810-4B5F-83FC-6118F9A28CF1", "role": "assistant", "thread_id": "922B245B-D1A6-4F52-8147-058F77FD5DB2", "delivery_state": "pending", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"text": "generate_task, query_tasks_by_member", "id": "9AB7E6CC-89AC-413C-9A7A-AFE1AA115739", "type": "toolName"}, {"text": "[1] query_tasks_by_member\n{\"member_id\":17,\"total\":0,\"ok\":true,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-15T16:35:58.904Z\",\"tasks\":[]}\n\n[2] generate_task\n{\"task_cards\":[{\"similarity_payload\":{\"similar_count\":\"0\",\"queried_first\":\"true\",\"member_source\":\"current_member_default\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-04-15T16:36:03.803Z\",\"source\":1,\"description\":\"目标：血压\\n动作：测量、监测\\n计划：daily\\n强度：每天 2 次\",\"status\":0,\"extract_payload\":{\"frequency\":\"\",\"target_metric\":\"血压\",\"action\":\"测量、监测\",\"intensity_or_value\":\"\",\"start_time\":\"\",\"confidence\":\"0.95\",\"task_type\":\"medical\",\"period\":\"none\"},\"ignored_reason\":\"\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-15T16:36:03.803Z\",\"type\":0,\"business_type\":\"ai_task_generation\",\"task_payload\":{\"task_medical\":\"{\\\"medical_task_type\\\":\\\"血压\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"测量、监测\\\",\\\"reminder_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-15T16:36:03Z\\\"}\",\"task\":\"{\\\"creator_id\\\":\\\"current_user\\\",\\\"repeat_type\\\":0,\\\"member_id\\\":17,\\\"source\\\":1,\\\"start_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-15T16:36:03.803Z\\\",\\\"priority\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":0,\\\"due_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-16T16:36:03.803Z\\\"}\"},\"member\":17,\"due_time\":\"2026-04-16T16:36:03.803Z\",\"repeat_type\":0,\"business_id\":\"\",\"title\":\"血压\",\"start_time\":\"2026-04-15T16:36:03.803Z\",\"id\":-1776270963,\"priority\":1}]}", "id": "521F8A0B-2A37-44AC-AC95-EB7A4AD966EA", "type": "toolContent"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：generate_task, query_tasks_by_member", "id": "4EC75E5E-B231-4D53-8A25-6B567F04FD85", "type": "operationalState"}, {"text": "{\"member_id\":17,\"total\":0,\"ok\":true,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-15T16:35:58.904Z\",\"tasks\":[]}\n[2] generate_task\n{\"task_cards\":[{\"similarity_payload\":{\"similar_count\":\"0\",\"queried_first\":\"true\",\"member_source\":\"current_member_default\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-04-15T16:36:03.803Z\",\"source\":1,\"description\":\"目标：血压\\n动