INFO 2026-04-15 16:36:11,234 accounts.api_io [request_id=DD222C16-05D7-4EB4-A5DF-5676EA6E55AE] HTTP 响应摘要: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ status=200 duration_ms=36 bytes=6705 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "POST, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"messages": [{"thread_id": "922b245b-d1a6-4f52-8147-058f77fd5db2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我三年高血压，帮我创建测量任务", "client_message_id": "eee21a59-aa5d-40b1-9850-905a52d81108", "server_message_id": "e5f0b751-035a-490c-a79d-69788ebf57de", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-15T16:35:55.897000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-15T16:36:11.213926+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "922b245b-d1a6-4f52-8147-058f77fd5db2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "根据您三年高血压的病史，我为您规划以下血压测量任务：\n\n## 🩺 血压测量任务建议\n\n### 日常监测任务\n| 项目 | 建议 |\n|------|------|\n| **测量频率** | 每天早晚各1次 |\n| **测量时间** | 晨起后、睡前（固定时间） |\n| **每次测量** | 连续测2-3次，取平均值 |\n| **记录内容** | 收缩压/舒张压、心率、测量时间 |\n\n### 任务提醒设置\n- **早测提醒**：每天 7:00\n- **晚测提醒**：每天 21:00\n- **复诊提醒**：每3个月一次\n\n### 血压控制目标\n| 指标 | 目标值 |\n|------|--------|\n| 收缩压 | < 140 mmHg（理想<130）|\n| 舒张压 | < 90 mmHg（理想<80）|\n| 心率 | 60-100 次/分 |\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 重要提示**：\n- 测量前静坐5分钟，避免运动、吸烟、饮咖啡后立即测量\n- 如血压持续≥140/90 mmHg 或 <90/60 mmHg，请及时就医\n- 按时服药，不要自行调整降压药剂量\n\n需要我帮您将这些任务添加到系统提醒中吗？", "client_message_id": "b0b62488-c810-4b5f-83fc-6118f9a28cf1", "server_message_id": "01a4d552-0829-4217-a72d-5b55286b5a9b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-15T16:36:11.183000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-15T16:36:11.225369+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"text": "generate_task, query_tasks_by_member", "id": "9AB7E6CC-89AC-413C-9A7A-AFE1AA115739", "type": "toolName"}, {"text": "[1] query_tasks_by_member\n{\"member_id\":17,\"total\":0,\"ok\":true,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-1